  "ai_language_tip": "Speak clear, polite standard Slovenian (sl); Croatian/Serbian are understood by many but use Slovenian; English is widely spoken by younger staff and in Ljubljana, Bled and the coast; Italian near the coast, Hungarian in Prekmurje.",
  "english_ok": "often — High English proficiency, especially under 50 and in tourism; still use Slovenian first at public offices and clinics.",
  "politeness": "Formal 'vikanje' (Vi), 'gospod/gospa'; open with 'Dober dan' and say whom you represent; close with 'Hvala, nasvidenje'.",
  "name_tip": "Surname first in bookings ('na ime Novak'); spell foreign names letter by letter; dual forms exist for two people ('za dve osebi').",
  "phone_tip": "Mobile 0xx xxx xxx (9 digits with 0, e.g. 041/031/051/070), Ljubljana landline 01 + 7 digits, +386; SMS confirmation is common.",
  "time_tip": "TRAP: 'pol osmih' = 7:30, 'četrt na osem' = 7:15, 'tri četrt na osem' = 7:45; numbers read units first (25 = petindvajset); read back in 24h.",
  "number_tip": "Slovenian has dual forms ('dva', 'dve osebi'); numbers 21+ are read units first ('enaindvajset' = one-and-twenty), like German.",
  "avoid_calling": "Avoid lunch 12:00–14:00 at offices, dinner peak 19:00–21:00, calls after 20:00 and Sundays for offices; GP practices take calls in set hours.",
  "closed_days": "Since 2020 shops are closed on Sundays and public holidays (Trade Act ZT-1), except small shops at petrol stations, stations, airports, hospitals or owner-run small shops; holidays include 8 February, Easter Monday, 27 April, 1–2 May, 25 June, 15 August, 31 October, 1 November, 25–26 December.",
  "booking_channels": "zVem / eNaročanje for public health referrals; phone and web for private clinics; online booking pages and phone for salons; phone and email for restaurants; Wolt and Glovo for delivery.",
  "voice_menu": "Operators (Telekom Slovenije, A1, Telemach), banks, Pošta Slovenije and ZZZS use keypad IVR.",
  "callback_habits": "Clinics and salons send SMS reminders; small businesses confirm by SMS or call back; tourist farms (turistične kmetije) confirm by email.",
